Hi Han ,
When it comes to careers, Imperial students are always in high demand. That=
=E2=80=99s because many of the world=E2=80=99s top employers know our gradu=
ates have a reputation for being innovative and entrepreneurial =E2=80=93 a=
nd have a degree from a university consistently ranked as one of the best i=
n the world.
It=E2=80=99s never too soon to think about life after graduation and the su=
pport that can help you reach your career goals. From your first day at Imp=
erial, you=E2=80=99ll have access to a huge range of services to help you p=
repare for =E2=80=93 and secure =E2=80=93 the next step in your academic or=
 professional life.
One-to-one advice
You can meet our specialist careers advisers at one-to-one appointments thr=
oughout the year for help with planning your career journey, finding intern=
ships, practising interviews and developing your CV.
Expert mentoring
Connect with our alumni mentors and tap into the experience of over 220,000=
 Imperial graduates working across a range of industries and professional s=
ectors around the world.
Skills workshops
We=E2=80=99ve got a packed year-round programme of career development and s=
uccess workshops to help you start mapping out your next steps.
Employer networking
Meet top employers at our career fairs, forums and networking events all ye=
ar round. You can also find vacancies for graduate roles, internships and w=
ork placement opportunities on our online careers management platform, Jobs=
Live. [
